  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&quot;지층 지층 화석&quot;<br><br>배꼽에서 시작해서 머리까지 4-5번 부르면 도착. <br><br>지층은 손펴고 화석은 주먹집니다. <br><br>누가누가 빨리 올라가나 배틀!<br><br>1. 천천히 같이 연습<br>2. 빨리 연습<br>3. 도전! 독무대<br>4. 학생 배틀<br>5. 전체 일어나 완성하면 앉기  꼴찌 잡기<br><br>좀 많이 유치하긴한데 ㅋ 신나해서요. <br>오후에 졸려하거나 그럴 때 분위기 전환에 괜찮습니다. <br>중1은 머.... 재미있네요 ㅋ ^^;;<br></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvaof61cd349vmcksjsmj2yp9@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1920\" data-video-height=\"1080\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvaof61cd349vmcksjsmj2yp9/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33237700409&amp;signature=0I13kj7h49ENUIFXSoSCKBcxT34%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1920\" data-video-origin-height=\"1080\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvaof61cd349vmcksjsmj2yp9?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2YW9mNjFjZDM0OXZtY2tzanNtajJ5cDkiLCJ0aWQiOiIwNzQzZGJjNy04MTM5LTRmMDUtODU2NS0xODFmNmJkYTBlMWUiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODYzMTN9.aDQqYPH1268Ge1a2oOKKdKFCk3wQtMaRcyjm-hSRjiTj0jvRbZHAzFFqS8pHklphtMmW5cxWUhaaEUIBSKOHKQ&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
